   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{Principal }P=Rs.3,75,000,\\text{ rate }r=\\\\[5pt]&\\quad 14\\%,\\text{ time }t=1\\text{ year}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Amount }A=P(1+\\frac{r}{100})^{t}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad =3,75,000\\times (1+\\frac{14}{100})^{1}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad =3,75,000\\times 1.14\\\\[5pt]&\\quad =Rs.4,27,500\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Compound markup }=A-P\\\\[5pt]&\\quad =4,27,500-3,75,000\\\\[5pt]&\\quad =Rs.52,500\\end{aligned}\\]",
